"algorithm}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "2.1 Preparation {#21-preparation}"
msgstr "2.1 Préparation {#21-preparation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Import the necessary libraries and set up the environment for running the "
"quantum circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
